---
permalink: /assets/data/landing-pages.json
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---
{#- The pages a partner's tracking link may open, for the reviewer's picker
    (wt-landing-picker.js). Every public page is the sitemap's own list
    (lib/seo.js sitemapItems), so a page added to the site shows up here on the
    next build with nothing to maintain. Sign-up and Get the App are not in the
    sitemap (noindex) but are the two most common places to send someone, so
    they are added by hand. The Help Center is Zoho, not this site, so it can
    never appear. -#}
{%- set pages = [] -%}
{%- for item in collections.all | sitemapItems(crawl) -%}
  {%- set pages = (pages.push({ url: item.url, title: item.data.title or item.url }), pages) -%}
{%- endfor -%}
{
  "extra": [
    { "url": "/account/signup/", "title": "Create your WhereTo account" },
    { "url": "/get-app/", "title": "Get the WhereTo app (store buttons that carry the partner)" }
  ],
  "pages": {{ pages | dump | safe }}
}
